        <definition>sampling.create_sampling_grid_2d</definition>
        <argsstring>(diameter, n_axis_points)</argsstring>
        <name>create_sampling_grid_2d</name>
        <qualifiedname>sampling.create_sampling_grid_2d</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>diameter</type>
          <defname>diameter</defname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>n_axis_points</type>
          <defname>n_axis_points</defname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Creates a grid of positions (Vector3Ds), centered at 0. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The shape of the grid is a circle with diameter given by the parameter. n_axis_points is the number of points along an axis: The axis X Y will contain n_axis_points, equispaced. The other regions of space will contain only the points allowed by the size of the circle.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This function is only available in Python. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
