        <detaileddescription>
<para>They are got interpolating with the rotations of the uniform coverage. The parameter f (0 &lt;= f &lt;= 1) must be close to 0 to get orientations that are close to the given orientation<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Values from 0.1 (tight cluster) to 0.4 (loose) seem to be ok n - number of rotations requested</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
